### 1. 正常注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138005",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "小明"
}

### 2. 重复注册（用上面同一个手机号）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138005",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. 手机号格式错误
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "138",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 4. 密码太短
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138006",
  "password": "123"
}

### 5. 昵称传空串（验证默认昵称）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138007",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": ""
}


### 0. 先登录，把 token 存进变量
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138005",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token) %}

### 1. 不带 token 访问受保护接口
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info

### 2. 带错误 token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer abc123def456

### 3. 带正确 token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

